---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | James">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-semibold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-neural-900 to-neural-700 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        About
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio Section -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold mb-6 text-neural-800">
        Who I am
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none font-body text-neural-700 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p>
          I left a prosperous and fun career to become a freshman. This decision wasn't motivated by anything external.</li>
          It was driven by an evolutionary tension made up of three fundamental needs:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal ml-6 space-y-2">
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-neural-800">Growth</span> — I outgrew what that trajectory — goods and services — could offer.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-neural-800">Integrity</span> — I craved integration between who I am and what I do.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-neural-800">Service</span> — I felt an all-consuming urge to tackle more pressing problems for humanity.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>I sought greater fulfillment by becoming more myself. That's all….</p>
        <p>
          Over these three years in the graduate program, the latent potential in those
          impulses unfolded spectacularly. The challenges have catalyzed my growth in
          astounding ways -- best decision ever! 
        </p>
        <p>
          My approach to research is grounded in the pursuit of my highest moral and philosophical ideals — truth / clear vision,
          honesty / transparency, and authentic relationship / collaboration.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through this approach, I want to give something original and useful to society. 
          I don't know exactly what that will look like, but I do know that it will be beautiful and bad ass, 
          like all original and useful contributions from everyone are. 
        </p>
        <p>
          Right now, I want a lab where I can develop my research skills by driving a project to a meaningful, impactful synthesis over the next two years.
        </p>
        <p>
          Beyond that, I see myself building ultra-functional teams of diverse specialists and facilitating deep collaboration to tackle our most complex problems, and 
          driving environmental policy changes to combat the causal roots of several disease burdens on society.  

          This life mission stretches the limits of all experience and skills I've acquired over 52 years,
          and it feels a bit beyond my capabilities and scary. Sweet.  

          So, if you'd like to connect, you'll know where to find me: 
          I'll on the path of ever-increasing fulfillment by becoming more myself. 
          
          Click one of the  buttons below to travel together. 1 + 1 = more   
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Research Focus -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold mb-6 text-neural-800">
        Research focus
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-synapse-light/10 to-synapse/10 rounded-lg p-6 border border-synapse-light/30">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-synapse-dark">
            Organoid Electrophysiology
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neural-700 font-body">
            Developing methods for long-term multi-electrode array recordings of human midbrain organoids 
            to study neural network dynamics.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-dendrite-light/10 to-dendrite/10 rounded-lg p-6 border border-dendrite-light/30">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-dendrite-dark">
            Computational Analysis
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neural-700 font-body">
            Building adaptive burst detection algorithms and statistical models to quantify treatment 
            effects while accounting for biological variability.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neural-200/30 to-neural-300/30 rounded-lg p-6 border border-neural-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-neural-800">
            Parkinson's Disease
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neural-700 font-body">
            Investigating how environmental neurotoxins like 6-OHDA fundamentally reorganize 
            neural network coordination and dynamics.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-synapse-dark/10 to-neural-800/10 rounded-lg p-6 border border-synapse-dark/30">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-synapse-dark">
            Pipeline Development
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neural-700 font-body">
            Containerizing analysis workflows for deployment on high-performance computing clusters 
            to enable large-scale analysis.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Publications & CV -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold mb-6 text-neural-800">
        Academic profile
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-8 border border-neural-200">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2 text-neural-800">Education</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-neural-700">
              <span class="font-semibold">PhD in Biomolecular Engineering and Bioinformatics (in progress)</span><br/>
              University of California, Santa Cruz
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2 text-neural-800">Links</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-body">
              <a href="mailto:james.lafemina@gmail.com" class="text-synapse hover:text-synapse-dark transition-colors">
                Email
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/JamesVLF" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-dendrite hover:text-dendrite-dark transition-colors">
                GitHub
              </a>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jameslafemina" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-synapse hover:text-synapse-dark transition-colors">
                LinkedIn
              </a>
              <a href="/cv.pdf" class="text-synapse-dark hover:text-synapse transition-colors">
                Download CV (PDF)
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold mb-6 text-neural-800">
        Get in touch
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-neural-600 font-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Interested in collaboration, want to chat about research, or just curious about the work? 
        Feel free to reach out.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:james.lafemina@gmail.com" class="inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-synapse to-dendrite text-white font-body font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        Send me an email
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
